      "writtenOn": "2024-06-05T23:27:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting, I appreciate the background. That makes sense. \n\nI\u0027m not familiar with `SkRefCnt`, but I now see that it overloads the `\u003d` operator to free the existing memory before re-assigning, so it\u0027s indeed not leaking.\n\nI\u0027ll see if `SkGraphics::PurgeFontCache` does what I\u0027m looking for.",
